{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这下可不是闹着玩的了。”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4273", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0879", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今早，社团教室前又被放了纸箱。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "箱子里有一只出生后没几个月的黑猫。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是第２只被弃养的猫了。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还没找到能领养白猫的饲主，又增加了新问题。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "白猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咪～”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "白猫", "alt_speaker_idx": 438, "voice": "wc0006", "char_id": "白猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "黒猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咪～咪～”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "黑猫", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "bc0000", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "２只小猫互相呼应似的咪咪叫了起来。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么要做这么过分的事……”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0975", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“猫好寂寞。”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "sk1255", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁不能原谅做这种事的人。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3394", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，必须想个对策才行。要是弃猫继续增加就糟了。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4274", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0880", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐，你还好吗？”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，抱歉喔，我明明是部长……”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0881", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐看起来大受打击。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪注意到她的情况，在身旁握着她的手。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像这种时候，我们必须成为她的力量才行。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，先跟万智老师商量看看吧。这不是靠我们就能解决的问题。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，我也觉得那样做比较好。”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4275", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐也同意吗？”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0882", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐？”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……嗯，说的没错。找八冢老师商量看看比较好呢。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0883", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐悲伤的模样看了让人很难受。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "必须想办法改善这个状况才行。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……所以，我就想说也和学园长商量看看。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "mc0268", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“原来如此啊。听起来不妙呢……”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0559", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟万智老师说明情况后，我们决定向学园长寻求帮助。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对不起。都是我的错，给大家造成麻烦了……”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0884", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是美羽学姐的错喔。是弃养小猫的饲主不对。”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0976", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊，美羽学姐不需要道歉的……”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3395", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算是那样，如果弃养动物的家伙继续增加就是大问题了。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0560", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那你说该怎么办啊！”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4276", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为了思考对策，大家才集合起来的吧？”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0561", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“身为学园长，应该有什么好方法吧？”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4277", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛，如果真有什么好方法，我愿意把万智嫁过去换取呢。”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0562", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“才不需要。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4278", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不需要……呜呜，说的也是。对濑名同学来说，老师是不需要的呢。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "mc0269", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，我不是那个意思……”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4279", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "简单来说，就是没有好方法的意思。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，怎么办？”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "sk1256", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最糟就是通宵监视，试着抓到弃养猫的饲主。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是再有更多人误会我们社团的目标就困扰了。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之现在能做的，我觉得可以贴禁止弃养动物的标语在社团门口。”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，这是一定要做的。”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0563", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“标语我来做吧。”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0977", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也帮忙。”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话虽如此，这并不是根本的解决之道。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果这样还不能解决弃养动物的现象的话……”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0564", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……如果不能解决的话要怎么样？”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4280", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0565", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长没有继续说下去，只是看着美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的眼神绝对不是无情。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……交给部长做判断吧，就我的立场来说。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0566", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0885", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，请多加注意今后的状况。还有，如果再发生什么事务必向我报告，知道了吗？”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0567", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跩什么跩啊。”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ar4281", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我是学园长♪”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0568", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在母女两人快要吵起来的气氛中，美羽学姐行了礼准备离开。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪伴随在她身边，我也打算随着她们两人离开。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……虽然你们说要保护动物。”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0569", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是今后会发生什么事呢？”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0570", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0886", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只是自言自语，忘了吧。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "rk0571", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "pn0331", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "黒猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咪～咪～”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "黑猫", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "bc0001", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "白猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咪～”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "白猫", "alt_speaker_idx": 438, "voice": "wc0007", "char_id": "白猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后的社团教室。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纸箱中，２只猫紧紧依偎着熊喵。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来小猫已经完全把熊喵当成母亲了。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0887", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐在那之后一直很消沉。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时的她看着箱子里的猫咪们，背影显得很寂寞。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我做的事情，是不是错了？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0888", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐喃喃自语，正在制作标语的我和纱凪互看了一眼。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我第一次看到这么脆弱的学姐。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连之前废社骚动的时候，她也没有说出这种话……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐没有做错。”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0978", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊。”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我赞同纱凪的话。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在的我们，只能做到这点程度的支持。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，如果我没有创立这个社团，或许小猫们就不会被弃养了……”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0889", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "黒猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咪～”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "黑猫", "alt_speaker_idx": 462, "voice": "bc0002", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "白猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咪～咪～”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "白猫", "alt_speaker_idx": 438, "voice": "wc0008", "char_id": "白猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到猫咪们的叫声，学姐咬紧了下唇。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾，你转过去那边。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0979", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪走到学姐身旁，声音温柔地安慰她。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我听到背后传来吸鼻子的声音，明白了为什么她要叫我转身。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有没有什么办法能让学姐打起精神来呢？", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "小猫需要人照顾，但现在的学姐更让人担心。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“各位，请慢走～♪”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3396", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟美羽学姐只是暂时回去而已。”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0980", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很快就会回来吗？”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3397", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，虽然现在是熊喵在照顾，但我还是担心小猫……”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0890", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“既然如此，那我也回来吧。”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行。你家太远了。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0981", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太阳快下山了，不能留学姐跟纱凪在社团教室。”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太阳下山后跟男人待在社团教室里更危险吧！”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0982", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我这么不被信任啊。”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今后我也不打算信任男人！”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0983", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪伸手驱赶我。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个反应跟以前不同，可爱得甚至让我想微笑。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果是这样的话，安洁有个好主意。”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3398", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好主意？”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，小猫咪们交给安洁来照顾就好了喔！”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3399", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，各位请回家好好纾解身心的疲劳吧。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3400", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不可以那样的。我们平常就已经受到很多小菜夏的照顾了。”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0891", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐才是，工作过头了。”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3401", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁可是知道美羽学姐会在深夜偷跑来社团教室的喔！”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3402", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？深夜偷跑来……”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……只是偶尔而已。因为担心大家的状况……”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0892", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且小纱同学也是。”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3403", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不用提我的事啦。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0984", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真拿这两个人没办法啊。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "居然在社团活动结束后还跑来……", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过，也是因此才有这么深的羁绊吧。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这两个人真的好厉害。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天起，大家就是开开心心的三连休了。美羽学姐和小纱同学都请好好休息吧！”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3404", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁也在用她的方法支持美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "猫咪由安洁照顾的话就能安心了。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然如此……", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐，明天要不要去哪里走走转换一下心情呢？”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……？”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0893", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“逛街之类的休闲或许能稍微振奋心情。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道你很担心小猫们，不过我觉得精神一直绷得这么紧不好。”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔～新吾居然也有这么好的提议。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0985", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，明天跟我一起……”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸，等一下等一下等一下！”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0986", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你趁机说些什么啊？那根本就是约会吧！”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0987", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，我没有那个意思……”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“骗鬼！你的企图太明显了！”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0988", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐，请放心吧。我会保护你远离这个男人的毒牙的！”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0989", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“保护……”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也要一起去！我不可能让你跟美羽学姐两个人独处！”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0990", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然变成三个人，学姐觉得怎么样呢？”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯，那个……”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0894", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“答案是Yes！美羽学姐、小纱同学和新吾同学的三角关系让安洁兴奋得克制不住了！”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3405", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会发生让安洁兴奋的事情喔。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那么，就听从大家的好意吧。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0895", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“决定了呢，新吾同学，加油！”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": "ag3406", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你只是负责提东西的喔！”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "sn0991", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了解。”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "mu0896", "char_id": "みう"}]}
